// The last 3 entries of CHANGELOG.md, for the "What is new" page when the app is offline.
// Do not edit by hand: run npm run changelog (a test checks that this is the same as CHANGELOG.md).
export const RECENT_CHANGES = `## 0.17.0 — 2026-10-29

- Change the address, the title and the description of your site in the site sheet (the gear button). The RSS feed and the sitemap use these values.
- The site sheet warns when your site still uses the address of the template.

## 0.16.0 — 2026-10-25

- Android: share photos from another app to a gallery. The app must be installed on the phone.
- iPhone: an Apple Shortcut sends photos to the inbox of a site. The site screen shows "N photos waiting".
- Open the inbox to add the waiting photos to a gallery. Tap Discard to delete a waiting photo.
- A help page explains the Shortcut. Shared photos stay in the history of the site. Remove the location from a photo first, or use Add photos.

## 0.15.0 — 2026-10-22

- The Preview shows your page in the colours and fonts of your site, also when the app uses the dark theme. This works for blog posts, pages, galleries and links pages.
- The Preview shows the title of the page at the top, as on the site.
- The app reads the look from the site's style.css the first time you open Preview, and keeps it on the device for offline use.
- A font that the app does not have shows as the next font in your site's font list.`;
